      `they are weeks in an employment I lost or left as described in subsection (1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are they weeks of insurable employment in an employment that you lost or left, as subsection 30(1) describes?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May these weeks of insurable employment not be used for the number of weeks or the rate of my benefits` IF
    `Schedule II para 9(2) s 30(6) the weeks may not be used for the purposes of subsection 12(2) or section 14` `the day` `they are weeks in an employment I lost or left as described in subsection (1)`

@export Have I accumulated enough weeks with another employer since my suspension to avoid disentitlement (Schedule II, paragraph 10)?
