GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Have I accumulated enough weeks with another employer since my suspension to avoid disentitlement` IF
    `Schedule II para 10 s 31(c) the claimant has accumulated with another employer the weeks required under section 7` `the day` `my weeks of insurable employment with another employer since the suspension began` `the number of weeks required under section 7 to qualify to receive benefits`

